  "description": "Mythic Upgrades adds new mythic crystals & gems to the game! Explore new cave biomes, upgrade your netherite gear or brew new potions!",
  "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/supports-fabric%20%7C%20forge%20%7C%20neoforge-darkred?labelColor=2D2D2D&amp;style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/available-1.20.1%20%7C%201.21.1-purple?labelColor=2D2D2D&amp;style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/requires-terrablender-yellow?labelColor=2D2D2D&amp;style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/gT8864sMNQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1005186301496131634?color=blue&amp;labelColor=2D2D2D&amp;label=JOIN DISCORD&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a>\n  <img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_663567.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" />\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/z9AqSn3.png\" alt=\"Mythic Upgrades Title\" width=\"100%\" />\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/trique\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BeZMFYy.png\" alt=\"We're partnered with BisectHosting! Use code trique to get a 25% discount!\" width=\"100%\" /></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q0sbyk2.png\" alt=\"RUBY: Ruby armor provides Blood Thirst. The effect gathers the blood from the environment and heals you. Ruby tools steal life on hits and regenerate health on uses. TOPAZ: Topaz armor provides Topaz Reaction. The effect creates damage waves as reactions when you get hit. Topaz tools create topaz waves on third interactions. CITRINE: Citrine armor provides Static Field. The effect creates a sphere field around you and always damages entities around you. Citrine tools make charged enemies summon lightning bolts upon their death. PERIDOT: Peridot armor provides Miasma. The effect creates poison waves regularly. Peridot tools apply a lethal incubation on enemies, releasing a wave of poison upon their death. JADE: Jade armor provides Jade Aura. The effect provides increased speed and jump boost, and leaves behind jade aura traces, allowing other entities to benefit as well. Jade tools permanently grant Jade Aura whenever you interact. AQUAMARINE: Aquamarine armor provides Ice Shield. The effect freezes enemies that attack you. Aquamarine tools freeze enemies on hits and create freezing waves upon their death. SAPPHIRE: Sapphire armor provides Damage Deflection. The effect deflects a certain percentage of the damage you take back to your opponent. Sapphire tools deal additional damage based on enemies' maximum health. AMETRINE: Ametrine armor provides Arcane Aura. The effect creates levitation waves when you get hit. Ametrine tools levitate enemies on hits. NECOIUM: Necoium is the main material to craft all mythic items. Necoium generates in the Overworld. Craft Necoium Carrots to get Necoium Share effect! WIKI: See the Mythic Upgrades Wiki to achieve more information about the mod. Get more about world generation, uses of items, recipes, effect descriptions and more!\" width=\"100%\" />\n</p>",
